  "translation": "This afternoon, I went to the store with my friend to buy a book. The store is in the northern part of the school. We arrived at the store and saw some books. I wanted to buy a book about history, and my friend wanted to buy a novel. He asked me, 'What kind of book do you like best?' I said, 'I haven't decided yet. Let me look some more and then talk.' Later I saw a very thick book that was red. My friend said, 'That book is very good. Can I take a look?' I said, 'Okay. I think the content is not bad.' So I bought that book. We went to pay together. I gave him one hundred yuan, and he gave me forty yuan change. We left the store."
